Design an EdTech platform like Udemy, Pluralsight
Functional requirements:
There are two types of users: learners and creators. 
1. Users should be able to sign up and access the system securely 
2. Creators should be able to create learning content 
3. Content can be combinations of rich text, images, videos and audio 
4. Multi-Platform Access: The system should be usable via a web browser and native applications (desktop and mobile). 
Non functional requirements:
1. Scalability
2. Reliability
3. Maintainability 
4. Security focused
5. Availability

Users/learners login - authentication service takes care of handling the authentication and authorization
