Two roles - we can implement simple IAM service - RBAC - Role Based Access Control, learners should be able to view the course but cannot edit or delete them
creators can upload the courses but cannot manage the feedback provided by learners

API gateway --> routes the request to the auth service

WAF - Web Application firewall , HTTPS - encrypted

